   "shape_m": "p",
   "html_text": "In all of the results presented in this article, the structure of the game (who is playing, what are the preferences of the players, and which actions are available) is assumed to be common knowledge among the players. There are of course many situations where the players do not have such complete information about the game. The models of games presented in Section 2 can be used to describe the beliefs of players with incomplete information about the game. However, these models cannot capture ca",
